            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kodi Campeau"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I decided to add cream of celery soup like someone else mentioned and it worked out really well. I also added some sour cream, shredded cheese, crumbled bacon, and velveeta cheese. I wanted more of a baked potato soup. Turned out really well. Definitely make it again!",
